OL,3,AMPs debate assisted dying bill for
OL,4,AEngland and Wales ahead of new Commons
OL,5,Avote
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bill would allow adults with fewer
OL,8,Fthan six months to live to apply to be
OL,9,Fgiven help to end their own life,
OL,10,Fsubject to certain safeguards - here's
OL,11,Fa quick guide
OL,13,FIt's the second attempt to change the
OL,14,Flaw - last year an identical bill was
OL,15,Fsupported by MPs, but stalled and ran
OL,16,Fout of time in the House of Lords
OL,18,FBoth sides expect the result to be
OL,19,Fclose - one person closely involved
OL,20,Ftells the BBC: "It's on a knife edge"
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
